   "notes": "Pre-deployment-contract stance champion (rise/hold/lower at full DR in sim). Hardware 08-10: its stand-up does NOT transfer \u2014 legs do air geometry with no ground force, then a knee stalls (trained before the rate clamp + self-collision limits were in the sim). Implication: keep only as fallback for Lower/holds; never use its RL Stand up \u2014 the Experiments-tab tuck is the stand-up.",
   "active": false
